<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, indef. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a certain nature, kind,</i>
			or <i>quality,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				770d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				10a27
			</span></i>, etc.; esp. joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τις</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				262e
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				8b25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιὰ ἄττα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					438b
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ποιόν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιότης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1083a11
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοναχῶς μὲν ἡ ποιότης λέγεται κατ᾽
					αὐτοὺς τοὺς Στωϊκούς, τριχῶς δὲ ὁ ποιός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.129
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				131
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				168
			</span></i>, al.: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοιαῦτα π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm.Math.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. μέλος</span>”
				<i>such-and-such,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PMag.Par.
					1.327
				</span></i>
			.</div>
